# `.env.backup` alone did not cover `.env.backup-pre-pgsql`, and a copy of
# .env carries every live secret — the OpenAI key, the directory API key,
# the database password. Any suffix, not one filename.
.env.backup*
.env.bak*
.env.local
.env.production
